    <string name="settings_tracking">traccia</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_title">traccia detalliat</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_body">adde cuffias connexa e tempore de audio. android solmente reporta eventos de conexion a applicationes que se executa, tunc isto mantenera un notification silentiose. bluetooth se traccia ambidue vias</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_unavailable">indisponibile usque accesso bluetooth se concede: iste compilatione solmente declara le tipo de servicio connectedDevice, que android 14+ conecta a permission bluetooth</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_title">conta solmente audio</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_body">statisticas conta le tempore quando audio se audiva realmente in locum de tempore de connexion. solmente sessionnes registrate con traccia detalliat activate mesura audio; le resto es omisate</string>
